SUMMARY:Dave Landau LIVE at Blue Note Hawaii
DTSTAMP:20260824T034000Z
DTSTART:20260826T183000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nDave Landau is one of the most sought-after stand-up comedians workin
	g today. Getting his start in Detroit at the Second City’s Conservatory\, 
	Dave developed a fast-paced\, sharp style with a strong improv background 
	that sets him apart from the crowd. \nHis laid-back demeanor and dark styl
	e of comedy landed him on Comedy Central’s This is Not Happening (3.1 mill
	ion views) and as a Season 8 finalist on NBC’s Last Comic Standing. He is 
	the creator of Normal World\, currently on BlazeTV\, and his impressive re
	sume includes The Artie Lange and Anthony Cumia Show\, The Anthony Cumia S
	how with Dave Landau\, and Louder with Crowder. \nDave has also appeared o
	n the Joe Rogan Experience\, Kill Tony\, Fox Across America\, Gutfeld!\, a
	nd Fox Saturday Night. He regularly performs at clubs and theaters across 
	the country and has opened for legends like Dave Chappelle\, Dennis Miller
	\, and Steven Wright. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Wednesday\, August 26\, 202
	6\nTime: 6:30 PM HST (Doors open at 5:00 PM)\nVenue: Blue Note Hawaii\, 23
	35 Kalakaua Avenue\, Honolulu\, HI 96815\nShow Duration: Approximately 75-
	90 minutes\nAge Restrictions: 18+ event\nNote: A second show is also avail
	able at 9:00 PM the same evening\n\nAbout the Venue\nBlue Note Hawaii is H
	onolulu’s premier intimate live entertainment venue\, located at 2335 Kala
	kaua Avenue in the heart of Waikiki. Part of the legendary Blue Note Jazz 
	Club brand\, this venue brings world-class comedy and music to the islands
	 in an intimate\, club-style setting. \nThe venue features communal and pr
	emium seating with a first-come\, first-served policy — so arriving early 
	is highly recommended to secure the best seats. A full dinner menu and ful
	l bar are available throughout the show\, with a $20 food or beverage mini
	mum per person required. \nBlue Note Hawaii has a capacity of approximatel
	y 300 guests\, creating an incredibly intimate atmosphere where you feel c
	lose to the performer. The Waikiki location means you’re steps away from t
	he beach\, world-class restaurants\, and the vibrant nightlife of one of t
	he world’s most famous resort destinations. \nWhat to Expect\nDave Landau’
	s show at Blue Note Hawaii is part of the venue’s acclaimed Blue Note Come
	dy Series. This is an intimate stand-up performance in a dinner-club setti
	ng — a very different experience from a large arena show. \nExpect sharp\,
	 fast-paced comedy with a dark edge\, delivered in an up-close-and-persona
	l environment. Dave’s improv background means no two shows are exactly ali
	ke — he feeds off the crowd and the energy of the room. Arrive at 5:00 PM 
	when doors open to enjoy dinner before the show and secure your preferred 
	seating. \nThis is the early show (6:30 PM). A late show is also available
	 at 9:00 PM for those who prefer a later start. Both shows are 18+ only\, 
	so please bring valid photo ID. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $25 – $
	35 (plus fees\; resale prices may vary) \n\nPremium Seating: $35 (+$10.90 
	fees)\nLoge Seating & Bar Area: $25 (+$9.10 fees)\n$20 food or beverage mi
	nimum per person required at the venue\n\nPurchase official tickets throug
	h TicketWeb (Ticketmaster partner)\, or find resale tickets through VividS
	eats. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate link
	s. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycale
	ndar.com/event/dave-landau-live-at-blue-note-hawaii-2/\n\nFrom Comedy Cale
	ndar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/dave-landau-live-at-blue-note-hawaii-2
	/
LOCATION:Blue Note Hawaii\, 2335 Kalakaua Avenue\, Honolulu\, HI\, 96815\, 
	United States
