SUMMARY:Phil Medina LIVE at Loony Bin Comedy Club Tulsa
DTSTAMP:20260824T034000Z
DTSTART:20260827T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets\nPhil Medina LIVE at Loony Bin Comedy Club Tulsa\nPo
	werhouse headlining comedian Phil Medina is coming to Loony Bin Comedy Clu
	b Tulsa for a night of non-stop laughs. Known for his high-energy performa
	nces and sharp comedic instincts\, Medina has headlined top clubs across t
	he country and is ready to bring the house down in Tulsa. \nEvent Details\
	nDate: Thursday\, August 27\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open 6:00 PM)\nVe
	nue: Loony Bin Comedy Club Tulsa\nAddress: 6808 S Memorial Dr\, Ste. 234\,
	 Tulsa\, OK 74133\nAge Requirement: 18+ Only\nTicket Price: $20 \nAbout Ph
	il Medina\nPhil Medina is a powerhouse headlining comedian who has perform
	ed at top clubs including the Laugh Factory\, Hollywood Improv\, and the I
	ce House. With a high-energy style that blends sharp wit with crowd-pleasi
	ng humor\, Medina has built a reputation as one of the most entertaining l
	ive performers on the national comedy circuit. His relatable material and 
