	g through his relatable and consistently funny material. Fans can expect a
	 polished\, entertaining set full of genuine laughs. \nEvent Details\nDate
	: Thursday\, August 27\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenu
	e: Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\nAddress: 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramen
	to\, CA 95825\nAge Restriction: 18+ / 2 Beverage Minimum \nAbout the Venue
	\nPunch Line Comedy Club Sacramento is Northern California’s most celebrat
	ed comedy destination. Located at 2100 Arden Way\, this intimate club has 
	been a cornerstone of the Sacramento comedy scene for decades. \nThe venue
	 features general admission and preferred premium seating\, a full bar\, a
	nd the classic two-drink minimum. The cozy room ensures every audience mem
	ber gets an up-close\, personal experience. Parking is available in the ad
	jacent shopping center lot. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo headline stan
	d-up performance by Ray Lau. Multiple shows are available August 27–29\, s
	o check for your preferred date and time. Expect an evening of sharp\, eng
	aging comedy in an intimate club setting. Shows run approximately 75–90 mi
	nutes. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from approximately $46 – $68 (a
	ll-in pricing\, fees included before taxes). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tick
	ets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no e
