SUMMARY:Roy Wood Jr. LIVE at Blue Note Hawaii (Friday Early Show)
DTSTAMP:20260824T034000Z
DTSTART:20260828T183000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nRoy Wood Jr. is one of the most versatile and celebrated comedians wo
	rking today. An Emmy-nominated comedian\, documentary producer\, WGA-nomin
	ated writer\, actor\, and radio personality\, Wood Jr. is best known for h
	is eight years as a correspondent on Comedy Central’s Emmy-winning The Dai
	ly Show (2015–2023). \nIn 2023\, he guest hosted The Daily Show and headli
	ned the White House Correspondents’ Dinner to its highest ratings since 20
	17. His fourth stand-up special\, Lonely Flowers\, premiered on Hulu on Ja
	nuary 17\, 2025\, earning widespread critical acclaim. He is also the host
	 of CNN’s Have I Got News for You\, an American adaptation of the long-run
	ning UK comedy series. \nWood Jr. recently released his debut memoir The M
	an of Many Fathers with Crown Publishing (October 2025) and will appear al
	ongside Keanu Reeves and Jonah Hill in the upcoming comedy film Outcome. F
	orbes has called him “One of comedy’s best journalists\,” and Variety name
	d him “One of 10 Comics to Watch.” \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 
	28\, 2026 \nShow Time: 6:30 PM HST (Doors open at 5:00 PM) \nVenue: Blue N
	ote Hawaii\, 2335 Kalakaua Avenue\, Honolulu\, HI 96815 \nAge Restriction:
	 18+ Event — Valid photo ID required at entry \nContent Warning: Adult lan
	guage and mature themes \nAbout the Venue\nBlue Note Hawaii is Honolulu’s 
	most celebrated intimate live entertainment venue\, located at 2335 Kalaka
	ua Avenue in the heart of Waikiki. As part of the iconic Blue Note Jazz Cl
	ub brand\, this venue has hosted some of the world’s greatest performers i
	n an atmosphere that blends tropical island charm with sophisticated night
	life. \nThe venue offers communal seating on a first come\, first served b
	asis — arriving early is strongly recommended to secure the best seats. A 
	full bar and complete dinner menu are available throughout the show\, with
	 a $20 food or beverage minimum per person. The intimate layout ensures ex
	cellent sightlines from virtually every seat in the house. \nBlue Note Haw
	aii’s warm\, inviting atmosphere makes it the perfect setting for an eveni
	ng of world-class comedy. Parking is available throughout the Waikiki area
	\, with multiple nearby garages and street parking options within easy wal
	king distance. \nWhat to Expect\nThis early Friday evening show features R
	oy Wood Jr. performing his signature brand of sharp\, socially observant s
	tand-up comedy. Known for his charismatic delivery and thought-provoking m
	aterial\, Wood Jr. blends current events\, personal storytelling\, and raz
	or-sharp wit into a seamless and unforgettable performance. \nAudiences ca
	n expect a polished\, high-energy set from one of comedy’s most respected 
	voices. Wood Jr.’s material is both hilarious and insightful — the kind of
	 comedy that makes you laugh and think at the same time. This is a rare op
	portunity to see a major comedy headliner in an intimate club setting in H
	awaii. \nDoors open at 5:00 PM\, giving you plenty of time to settle in\, 
	enjoy a full dinner from the menu\, and grab drinks before the show begins
	. Seating is communal and first come\, first served — arrive early for the
	 best spots. This is an 18+ event — please bring valid photo ID. \nTicket 
	Information\nPrice Range: $45.90 – $56.67 (includes fees and taxes) \n\nPr
	emium Seating: $45 + fees\nLoge Seating & Bar Area: $35 + fees\n\nTickets 
	are limited to 6 per order. No refunds or exchanges — all sales are final.
	 This event is 18 and over. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post c
	ontains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
	\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/roy-wood-jr-live-at-blue-note-hawaii-
	friday/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/roy-wood-jr-live-at-blue-note-hawaii-f
	riday/
LOCATION:Blue Note Hawaii\, 2335 Kalakaua Avenue\, Honolulu\, HI\, 96815\, 
	United States
